{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Everyman — the inherited cameo\n\nUndertale Easter egg ('strangeman' in the files) that reappears with no narrative weight as a cameo or graffiti throughout Deltarune.","x":-190,"y":-80,"width":400,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nSame kind of narratively-weightless nod — 'Easter Egg' category on the wiki.","x":-130,"y":-538,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Spamton**\nCameos tied to the real-world merchandise — appears in the Spamton Sweepstakes.","x":-130,"y":398,"width":270,"height":160,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Is he Berdly?**\nBird beak, replaces a duck in Jevil's carousel, appears in Queen's attack, and his graffiti is in Hometown.","x":420,"y":-320,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Connection to Gaster?**\nIn the files, both share the '-man' naming pattern (strangeman / mysteryman) and a link to the True Lab.","x":420,"y":180,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**The unused Ch.4 variable**\n'everyman_appeared' exists in the code, unused, right before the Titan in the church.","x":-650,"y":-100,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"3"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND.png","x":-129,"y":-920,"width":191,"height":177},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton.gif","x":-129,"y":763,"width":228,"height":257},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Everyman_ducks_screenshot.webp","x":774,"y":-487,"width":253,"height":190},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gaster.png","x":778,"y":327,"width":74,"height":190},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_church.png","x":-900,"y":-320,"width":63,"height":110},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/everyman.png","x":-115,"y":-265,"width":251,"height":190}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s0","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"center-img-e","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"center","toSide":"left","color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img-e","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img-e","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"s2-img-e","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img-e","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img-e","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_friend_spamton","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_berdly_gaster","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_gaster_variable","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_variable_berdly","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}